  "title": "Mini Chocolate Cheesecakes with Graham Cracker Crust",
  "description": "These mini cheesecakes are easy and delicious! Made in a standard muffin tin with graham cracker crusts, these chocolate treats are perfect to serve as individual-sized desserts or to transport to a party.",
  "authors": [
